categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"Vnob_w_Aohf7ZDqxcJ9z2A","review_id":"_UL44nzcXO4PHhq6rwM3Ig","date":"2014-03-28T02:43:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9445596933364868,"text_excerpt":"Not bad at all! We have tried mot of the Vietnamese places in NOLA and a few on the West Bank. I liked this place better than any on the West Bank (sorry WB fans!), and although the menu is a little limited and is very standard for New Orleans Vietnamese (Pho, Bun, Rice plates, fresh rolls, etc.), I thought it was done well and was pleasantly surprised. The atmosphere was modern and trendy with good lighting and a touch of class. You would not be embarrassed to bring a first date here. It's small enough to feel intimate and the service was very good. Fast and attentive, but not too attentive! The down side to the space is the noise factor. We were there on a Thursday around 7:30-8:30, the..."},{"business_id":"Vnob_w_Aohf7ZDqxcJ9z2A","review_id":"FcwS6CT6a8DT8vGgWR6bmg","date":"2021-01-03T02:02:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9407551288604736,"text_excerpt":"Today I went to Mint, but decided to order something other than Pho. I been here before and have always enjoyed the vibe in this restaurant as it is a seat yourself type of place with quick service and the restaurant is not large but has that small cozy feeling with about 10 tables available. *The Vietnamese Banh Mi Burger was better than expected. The carrots and aioli was not overpowering and the flavors added a good taste to the burger that I would have never thought it needed. ...I will be ordering this again. *The Sticky Chicken Wings are a favorite of everyone I know there and these wings do not disappoint. The chicken is fried to perfection with a sweet mustard like sauce. It's onl..."},{"business_id":"Vnob_w_Aohf7ZDqxcJ9z2A","review_id":"RqJTH0HFvXVJWkX17gEvoQ","date":"2016-01-16T22:50:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9390541315078735,"text_excerpt":"I love a good bowl of Pho and my cravings are extra high on a super rainy day. I have been to Mint a few times and it is always a nice meal. The staff greats you with a nice smile and are very helpful. A combination Pho of all the different types of beef is usually what I order. The broth is not too salty and not too overpowering. It has a very fresh taste and when you add the mint the flavor is even better. My friend ordered a Vermicelli bowl which they enjoyed and had a solid taste. Both of our plates were wiped clean by the end of the meal. For a drink I went brave and tried the Vietnamese Cocktail. It was such a strange mix of flavors of sweet, coffee, bitter, and then some alcohol. I..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Vnob_w_Aohf7ZDqxcJ9z2A","photo_id":"Nk6FLM88wL0exTyax_7SqQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Nk6FLM88wL0exTyax_7SqQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9392200708389282},{"business_id":"Vnob_w_Aohf7ZDqxcJ9z2A","photo_id":"MecL2_zdAoZ-ADodqkxxTg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/MecL2_zdAoZ-ADodqkxxTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8885940313339233},{"business_id":"Vnob_w_Aohf7ZDqxcJ9z2A","photo_id":"aKdGu7-kSLiRGjLK8LPvSw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/aKdGu7-kSLiRGjLK8LPvSw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8400509357452393},{"business_id":"Vnob_w_Aohf7ZDqxcJ9z2A","photo_id":"AKrNXAKIpMQdiZKSqkrgeQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AKrNXAKIpMQdiZKSqkrgeQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8315499424934387},{"business_id":"Vnob_w_Aohf7ZDqxcJ9z2A","photo_id":"FJsVH29u8QGDdF_1zIobeQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FJsVH29u8QGDdF_1zIobeQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8262869119644165}]},"notebook_case":null}
